@startuml
title CloudNotes -- Note Data Model
hide methods
class Note {
  +id: Integer <<primary key>>
  +title: String(100)
  +body: Text
  +created_at: DateTime
}
class BackendAPI {
  +GET /api/notes
  +POST /api/notes
  +PUT /api/notes/{id}
  +DELETE /api/notes/{id}
}
database PostgreSQL
BackendAPI --> Note : validates and maps
Note --> PostgreSQL : persisted as table rows
note right of Note
title and body are required.
created_at is assigned on creation.
end note
@enduml
